('architecture', 'Senior systems architect', 'Connect the private publisher and static reader through a versioned contract.', '''Keep raw survey processing on the private server|Keep student hosting independent of Shiny|Use two public JSON files as the interface|Commit matching files together|Maintain explicit schema versions|Support the legacy empty publication|Keep semantic identity separate from publication identity|Define an exact-byte SHA256 contract|Keep one shared update coordinator|State the single-worker deployment assumption|Use asynchronous background computation|Preserve last-good state on component failures|Bound retries and timeouts|Separate preparing from authorizing publication|Avoid new database infrastructure without need|Define startup cooldown after lost process state|Pin immutable source revisions during reads|Make rollback a forward commit|Document component responsibilities|Review cross-component failure scenarios'''),
